"""
APEX Pattern P04: Legacy Migration Pipeline
Generated by APEX Data Agent (Deterministic, Metadata-Driven)

Pattern: Legacy Sources (DTSX/EBCDIC/Fixed-Width/COBOL) → Transient → Raw → Silver → Gold
Contract Type: {{ contract_type | default('STANDARD') }}

DAG ID: {{ dag_id }}
Feed Group ID: {{ feed_group_id }}
Domain: {{ domain }}
Environment: {{ environment | default('dev') }}

CONTROL PLANE: This DAG executes a ResolvedExecutionPlan (no decisions in Spark jobs)
DATA PLANE: Spark jobs read execution plan and execute deterministically

Production Pattern: Multi-feed support with inputparam structure
Note: All IDs are numeric (fetched from PostgreSQL via max() + 1)
"""

